#
# Security region: host, locked
#
# sec_host_hardened, and for good until the next boot: no module can be
# loaded (kernel.modules_disabled), nothing attaches to anything (Yama 3),
# and /proc shows a process to its own user and to root only (hidepid).
#
# And no USB device the firmware does not declare internal is configured
# from the first moment of boot until moonwater usb lets it in: the policy
# is read once /root is, and without this word a stick or a keyboard plugged
# in before then is up until it is (USB-D1 in .github/SECURITY.md).
#
CONFIG_MOONWATER_STRICT_HOST=3

#> cmdline usbcore.authorized_default=2
